{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は高校の友達と\nお台場にいってきました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヴィーナスフォート行って\nモダン焼き食べてみたり\n『ぼてじゅう』っていう\nお店なのですがふぁみたんは\n食べたことあるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら今度食べてみてね( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近あたしのぶろぐなんだか\n食べ物紹介のぶろぐみたいに\nなってきてる←え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもさでもさ、ふぁみたんが\n美味しいもの食べれてると\n思うといいかなから～なんてね( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、これちなみに\nヴィーナスフォートの\n大噴水だよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/01/23/4507591/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか全然どこにいるか\n分からない....。w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際は凄いきれいで\n感動したよ( •ㅈ• )わー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観覧車もあったんだけど\n点検中かなんかで\n乗れなかった(´;ω;`)う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーー乗りたかったな♡\nでも観覧車って少しだけ怖い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、でもかなりんみたいに\n高所恐怖症じゃないよ？\nんー何かでも怖いんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーーーやばい今日どうぶつの森\nやってない(´;ω;`)うわーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変だ！それでは皆さん\nゲームの世界に飛び込んできます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/01/23/4507591/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田 斎藤 斉藤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はまあやのことを\nまあや！と変ななまりを\nいれて呼ぶのがクセ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、文字じゃ伝わらない(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}